### BloodCastle ###
	EarlyFinishRestriction  Prevents turning in the weapon to the
	                        Archangel King before EarlyFinishMinTime has
	                        elapsed since the event started, 0/1.
	EarlyFinishMinTime      Minimum event time (seconds, counted from
	                        the event's START state) before the weapon
	                        can be turned in.

### BloodCastle::Timing ###
	WarningTime/NotifyTime/EventTime/CloseTime in minutes.

### BloodCastle::KillRequirement ###
	MonsterKillReqPerPlayer  Monsters that must be killed (per
	                         player in the event) before the gate
	                         opens and the bridge falls.
	WizardKillReqPerPlayer   Wizards that must be killed (per
	                         player) after the gate falls, before
	                         the Saint Statue appears.

### BloodCastle::EntryLevelMgDlRf::Castle / BloodCastle::EntryLevelStandard::Castle ###
	Level 0-7 (MAX_BC_LEVEL) - which Blood Castle level this row
	configures. Decides which Blood Castle a character can enter based
	on a combined level value: character Level (1-400) + MasterLevel
	(Master Skill Tree level, 0 before the 2nd class change). The two
	tables apply to different class groups:
	  EntryLevelMgDlRf   Magic Gladiator / Dark Lord / Rage Fighter
	                     (these classes level up faster, so they get
	                     lower thresholds).
	  EntryLevelStandard All other classes.
	MinLevel/MaxLevel  Combined-level range for this Blood Castle.
	                   MaxLevel=-1 means no upper bound.
	NOTE: since MasterLevel only exists after the 2nd class change,
	pre-2nd-change characters are matched by Level alone (MasterLevel
	is 0) - practically identical to the old hardcoded Level-only
	brackets for levels 0-6. Level 7 (BC8) requires a combined level of
	401+, i.e. at least 1 Master Level - a character that just did the
	2nd change with 0 Master Level will match level 6 (BC7) until they
	gain their first Master Level point.

### BloodCastle::DailyEntryLimit ###
	Vip0-3  Maximum number of Blood Castle entries per day (any level),
	        per VIP tier (AccountLevel 0-3). Resets at midnight
	        (server local time). -1 = unlimited. Kept in memory only -
	        resets if the server restarts.

### BloodCastle::EntrySettings::Entry ###
	Level            0-7 (MAX_BC_LEVEL) - which Blood Castle level this
	                 row configures.
	MaxUser          Maximum characters allowed inside this level's
	                 instance at once.
	MinAccountLevel  Minimum VIP tier (AccountLevel) required to enter,
	                 -1 = no restriction.
	MinReset/MaxReset  Reset range required to enter. MaxReset=0 means
	                 no upper limit.
	MinMasterReset/MaxMasterReset  Grand Reset (Master Reset) range
	                 required to enter. MaxMasterReset=0 means no upper
	                 limit.

### BloodCastle::Schedule::StartTime ###
	One or more scheduled triggers, matched against the real-world
	clock (-1 = any/wildcard for that field):
	Year/Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute/Second.

### BloodCastle::ExperienceSettings::Experience ###
	Level 0-7 (MAX_BC_LEVEL) - Table1/Table2 experience reward
	values for that level.

### BloodCastle::MoneySettings::Money ###
	Level 0-7 - Table1/Table2 Zen reward values.

### BloodCastle::NpcLifeSettings::NpcLife ###
	Level 0-7 - GateNpcLife/StatueNpcLife HP for that level's gate
	keeper / Archangel statue.

### BloodCastle::RewardSettings::Reward ###
	Level 0-7 - WC/WP/GP (WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint) paid for
	clearing that level.
	GensContribution  Gens Family contribution points paid for
	                  clearing that level, 0 = none.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

